<div class="hero-c" style="top:260px"><span class="eb">Overgrown Altar</span><h1 class="h1" style="margin-top:22px">The Launch Manifesto</h1>
<p class="it" style="margin:28px 0 0;max-width:640px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.45;color:#E6DFD0">And if thou make an altar of stone unto me, thou shalt not build it of hewn stones; for if thou lift up a tool upon it, it shall be defiled.</p><span class="eb" style="margin-top:16px;font-size:11px">Exodus xx · xxv</span></div></section>
<section class="sec paper"><div class="narrow center" style="gap:26px"><span class="num" style="font-size:120px">I</span><h2 class="h2">Built Without Tools of Pride</h2><p class="lede" style="font-size:32px;line-height:1.45">We reject the polished, man-made altars of secular cynicism and performative intellect. In the ancient law, if a tool touched the altar stone, it was defiled. We build with unvarnished raw material—high craft, deep reverence, and unarmored truth.</p><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;justify-content:center"><span style="width:80px;height:1px;background:#9F945E"></span><svg width="18" height="26" viewBox="0 0 603 883" aria-hidden="true" style="display:block"><path fill="#9F945E" d="M302.5,874.8C301.9,872.7 300.2,850.6 298.0,817.0C296.9,799.7 295.1,774.0 294.0,760.0C292.9,746.0 291.5,725.5 291.0,714.5C289.8,689.3 289.8,594.6 291.0,552.5C292.6,497.2 293.3,386.5 292.2,375.7C290.3,358.2 281.5,345.0 268.5,340.0C261.2,337.3 237.4,336.2 182.5,336.1C135.1,336.0 120.4,337.5 102.9,344.2C96.1,346.8 87.9,352.3 85.7,355.7C84.1,358.2 81.2,356.9 77.5,352.2C67.3,339.4 56.9,335.0 27.4,331.5C9.1,329.3 8.0,329.1 8.0,327.6C8.0,326.5 16.9,325.0 40.5,322.3C52.6,320.9 65.5,314.4 77.5,303.6C83.4,298.2 84.2,298.1 87.9,301.8C92.4,306.2 105.2,312.0 115.3,314.1C129.1,317.0 184.3,318.6 230.0,317.4C265.1,316.5 265.6,316.4 269.5,314.0C282.5,306.1 289.0,298.7 291.2,289.0C292.2,284.8 292.5,268.4 292.4,220.5C292.3,131.8 291.4,123.6 278.4,103.2C276.5,100.3 275.0,97.5 275.0,97.0C275.0,96.5 277.4,93.7 280.4,90.7C292.3,78.8 297.1,63.6 301.6,23.8C303.9,3.2 305.5,2.7 306.3,22.2C307.5,50.2 313.0,69.5 324.9,86.9C327.1,90.0 330.0,93.6 331.4,94.9C334.5,97.8 334.7,100.1 332.0,102.5C328.8,105.4 322.2,118.0 320.6,124.4C316.6,139.5 315.7,157.2 315.6,218.0C315.5,281.4 315.9,287.1 320.8,296.3C327.0,307.8 338.1,314.7 353.3,316.2C369.6,317.8 476.5,316.6 486.5,314.7C501.2,311.8 507.7,309.2 516.3,302.6C521.4,298.7 523.4,298.2 524.7,300.4C526.1,302.8 536.4,310.6 541.5,313.2C554.5,31